WEBVTT

00:05:29.711 --> 00:05:32.600
Our shared spaces can better
reflect what matters to us,

00:05:32.624 --> 00:05:35.913
as individuals and as a community,

00:05:35.937 --> 00:05:39.873
and with more ways to share
our hopes, fears and stories,

00:05:39.897 --> 00:05:43.817
the people around us can not only
help us make better places,

00:05:43.841 --> 00:05:45.912
they can help us lead better lives.

00:05:46.285 --> 00:05:47.437
Thank you.

00:05:47.461 --> 00:05:52.034
(Applause)

00:05:52.058 --> 00:05:53.214
Thank you.

00:05:53.238 --> 00:05:58.677
(Applause)